12#issuecomment-142323441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/812","id":142323441,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE0MjMyMzQ0MQ==","user":{"login":"Bastian35022","id":14124625,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTI0NjI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14124625?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022","html_url":"https://github.com/Bastian35022","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-09-22T15:26:24Z","updated_at":"2015-09-22T15:26:24Z","body":"Yes, that's the issue i was referring to, sorry for the bad wording :/\n\nI am using DASH content, and i agree that it is usually not a good idea. However, it is necessary when you want to get down the latency by shortening the segment duration (fractional seconds in my case), while avoiding a bad compression efficiency through frequent usage of keyframes. This way you can end up starting with a number of consecutive segments without keyframes when tuning into a live stream.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/142323441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","